      "content": "Each method offers a different approach to equity in housing distribution. A lottery provides equal opportunity to all applicants, regardless of need or circumstance. Income-based allocation directly targets affordability to those most in need, promoting economic equity. Prioritizing transit access ensures residents have better opportunities for employment and community engagement, promoting access equity.",
